<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<title>The brokers — Halvorsen Pike Real Estate, Bellingham</title>
<meta name="description" content="Five brokers in one office on Tidewater Lane in Fairhaven. You'll deal with one broker from the first call to the keys.">
<meta property="og:title" content="The brokers — Halvorsen Pike Real Estate">
<meta property="og:description" content="Kari Halvorsen, Dana Pike, Mateo Ruiz, June Takahashi and Elliot Marsh, and the neighborhoods each knows best.">
</head>
<body>
{% render 'header', page: page, data: data %}
<main>
<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pt-14 pb-12 md:px-8 md:pt-20 md:pb-16" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow text-base-content/70">Since 2011</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,4vw+1rem,4.5rem)] leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.015em] text-balance">The brokers</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-[56ch] text-[1.1875rem] leading-relaxed text-base-content/80">Five of us, in one office on Tidewater Lane. You'll deal with one broker from the first call to the keys.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <ul class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pb-20 md:px-8 md:pb-28" data-reveal="stagger">
    {% for member in data.team %}
    <li class="grid gap-6 border-t border-base-300 py-10 sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[12rem_1fr_16rem] md:gap-10">
      <a href="/brokers/{{ member.id }}" class="block w-32 sm:w-auto">
        {% if member.photo %}<img src="{{ member.photo }}" class="aspect-[3/4] w-full rounded-box object-cover">{% else %}{% assign words = member.name | split: " " %}<div class="flex aspect-[3/4] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-box bg-base-200" aria-hidden="true"><span class="font-heading text-[3rem] font-light text-base-content/70">{{ words.first | slice: 0 }}{% if words.size > 1 %}{{ words.last | slice: 0 }}{% endif %}</span></div>{% endif %}
      </a>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.75rem,2vw+1rem,2.5rem)] leading-tight"><a href="/brokers/{{ member.id }}" class="hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4">{{ member.name }}</a></h2>
        <p class="facts mt-1 text-base-content/70">{{ member.role }}</p>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[56ch] text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-base-content/80">{{ member.short }}</p>
        <a href="/brokers/{{ member.id }}" class="more mt-5">More about {{ member.name | split: " " | first }}<svg class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <dl class="facts space-y-3 sm:col-start-2 md:col-start-auto">
        {% if member.knows.size > 0 %}<div><dt class="text-base-content/60">Knows best</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-[0.9375rem]">{{ member.knows | join: ", " }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if member.languages != blank %}<div><dt class="text-base-content/60">Languages</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-[0.9375rem]">{{ member.languages }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if member.phone != blank %}<div><dt class="text-base-content/60">Phone</dt><dd class="mt-0.5 text-[0.9375rem]"><a href="tel:+1{{ member.phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' }}" class="hover:underline">{{ member.phone }}</a></dd></div>{% endif %}
      </dl>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
<section id="office" class="bg-base-200 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6" data-reveal><img src="/media/office.jpg" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-box object-cover"></div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-6" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow text-base-content/70">The office</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(1.875rem,2.5vw+1rem,3.25rem)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.015em] text-balance">A brick storefront on Tidewater Lane</h2>
      <div class="prose-aspect mt-6">
        <p>Kari and Dana opened the agency in 2011 in the front room of this 1890s storefront, with two desks and a window onto the street. Mateo joined in 2014, June in 2016 and Elliot in 2019; the back room became the meeting room, and the window still holds a card for every home we have on the market.</p>
        <p>Come in when you're passing. There is coffee, and usually someone who knows the house you're curious about.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 font-medium">214 Tidewater Lane, Fairhaven · Monday to Friday 9 to 5:30, Saturday 10 to 3</p>
      <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/search?query=Fairhaven%2C%20Bellingham%2C%20WA" class="more mt-4">Get directions<svg class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="how-we-work" class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow text-base-content/70">How we work</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-[22ch] text-[clamp(1.875rem,2.5vw+1rem,3.25rem)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.015em] text-balance">Four things we always do</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4" data-reveal="stagger">
      {% for item in data.promises %}
      <li>
        <span class="brass-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-[1.375rem] leading-snug">{{ item.title }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-base-content/75">{{ item.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% render 'valuation-band' %}
</main>
{% render 'footer', data: data %}
</body>
</html>
